  "request_id": "xingcheng-single-root-governance-convergence-20261002-r2",
  "title": "Converge Xingcheng data governance on one canonical custody root",
  "summary": "Align A133 and the canonical residency metadata with B81's single-root rule so the general deployment topology cannot be read as permitting multiple Xingcheng-owned stores.",
  "requested_by": "decision-sovereign",
  "origin": "direct human-governor instruction 2026-10-02: 推進治理 following the single-folder Xingcheng data mandate",
